/* The input sections of the code that runs from the boot RAM (link_prog.ld, .bootcode): the 52 with the most misses of the I-cache per byte in the replayed race
   on track 4 (tools/s2/bootpick.py, a budget of 20000 bytes: more did not help, the sets of the cache they share matter as much). Made by the tool, checked at every
   build by link_check.py; docs/screamer2/performance.md, "Where the CPU waits". */
